\term{群作用}（group action）是映射$G\times\mathcal X\to\mathcal X$，
记$(g,x)\mapsto g\cdot x$，满足
\begin{equation}
 e\cdot x=x,\qquad (g_1g_2)\cdot x=g_1\cdot(g_2\cdot x)
